# Wireframe: IssueFormModal

## Purpose & Flow Context

Overlay dialog for creating or editing an issue. Entry: "New Issue" button on IssuesPage (create mode) or "Edit" button on IssueDetailPage (edit mode). Exit: Submit → issues list / detail page; Cancel or Esc → previous screen.

---

## Notation Legend

| Symbol | Meaning | Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|--------|---------|
| `[...]` | Button | `[>...▼]` | Dropdown |
| `_______` | Text input | `[X]` | Close |
| `○` | Unselected | `●` | Selected |
| `[#]` | Badge | `×` | Remove tag |

## Layout Regions

**Grid**: Modal overlay on the 12-col grid. Modal width: 600px (centered).

**No app-shell** — modal renders on top of the current page with backdrop.

**Content hierarchy**:
1. Title input — primary required field
2. Description — freeform body
3. Structured fields (status, priority, assignee, labels)

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX]                                 |
|  [X] Close                                                        |
|                                                                    |
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+ |
|  |  [h2] Create Issue / Edit Issue                              | |
|  |                                                              | |
|  |  Title *                                                     | |
|  |  ________________________________________________            | |
|  |                                                              | |
|  |  Description                                                 | |
|  |  ________________________________________________            | |
|  |  |                                                          | |
|  |  |                                                          | |
|  |  |                                                          | |
|  |  |_________________________________________________________| |
|  |                                                              | |
|  |  Status [>Todo ▼]    Priority [>No Priority ▼]              | |
|  |                                                              | |
|  |  Assignee [>Unassigned ▼]                                   | |
|  |                                                              | |
|  |  Labels                                                      | |
|  |  [#bug ×] [#ui ×] [+ Add label]                             | |
|  |                                                              | |
|  |  [Cancel]                                [ Save ]            | |
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+ |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Modal shell | Modal | Backdrop click = close; Esc = close | Focus trapped inside |
| Title input | Input | Required, max 255 chars | Shows inline error on empty submit |
| Description | Textarea | Optional, max 50000 chars | Auto-grow height |
| Status select | Select | Default "Todo" on create; current on edit | — |
| Priority select | Select | Default "No Priority" on create; current on edit | — |
| Assignee select | Select | Default "Unassigned" on create; current on edit | Searchable |
| Labels | Badge + ghost button | Existing labels as removable badges; "+" adds new | Type-ahead search |
| Cancel button | Button (secondary) | Close modal, no save | Unsaved changes? → future warning |
| Save button | Button (primary) | Submit form | Disabled + spinner while submitting |

## Data Display

Form layout — no data display. Labels shown as selected tag pills with remove action.

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| h2 "Create Issue" / "Edit Issue" | Title reflects mode | — |
| "Title *" | Required field label | Asterisk = required |
| "Description" | Optional body field | Placeholder "Add a description…" |
| "Status" | Workflow stage | Todo / In Progress / Done |
| "Priority" | Urgency level | No Priority / Urgent / High / Medium / Low |
| "Assignee" | Responsible person | Unassigned = default |
| "Labels" | Categorization tags | Free-form or select from existing |
| "Save" | Confirm changes | Primary button, validates first |
| "Cancel" | Abandon changes | No confirmation dialog |

## States

### Create (default)

All fields empty except Status = "Todo" and Priority = "No Priority". Title has focus on open.

### Edit (pre-filled)

All fields populated with current issue values. Title has focus on open.

### Submitting

Save button shows spinner, is disabled. All form fields disabled. Cancel remains enabled.

### Validation Error

Title empty on submit:
```
+-- Title * -------------------------------------------------------+
|  _________________________________________                       |
|  [⚠] Title is required                                           |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```
Red border on input, error message below. Form stays open.

### Error (API failure)

Inline error banner above form buttons:
```
+-- --------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [⚠] Could not save issue. Please try again.                   |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```
Form remains filled. Save re-enabled.

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>768px) | Modal 600px centered |
| Mobile (<768px) | Modal full-screen; fields stack in single column; footer sticky at bottom |

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | `role="dialog" aria-modal="true"` on modal container |
| Heading order | `h2` for modal title (h1 is the page behind) |
| Reading / Focus order | Title → Description → Status → Priority → Assignee → Labels → Cancel → Save |
| Accessible names | Close button `aria-label="Close"` |
| Keyboard operability | Tab through fields in order; Esc = close; Enter in field does not submit; Ctrl+Enter = submit |
| Focus trap | Tab cycles within modal; initial focus on title input; restore focus on close |
| Target size | All form controls and buttons ≥24×24 px |
| Non-color intent | Error states show icon + text, not just red color |
